Subject: web: hide the skip-login entry the standalone Host cannot honour

Why: the Host has no local mode, so 'skip login' silently did nothing. The web
client now rejects authEnterLocal and the login page hides both skip entries.
Same code as the upstream PR branch fix/web-skip-login-unavailable, merged after 0005.
Upstream: issue https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/issues/10601, PR https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/11049
Remove when: the PR is merged and upstream.lock moves past it.

